WEBVTT

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.500
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.500
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.670
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.670
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:50.580
DAI'S SECRET

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:56.140
The Dragon Knight is approaching.

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:57.850
He's close!

00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:58.970
The Dragon Knight?!

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.010
It's Baran!

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:05.600
They're connected by their crests.
He'll reach this castle soon!

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:08.230
We must ready our defenses!

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:09.400
Got it!

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:13.470
You and I will be the defense!

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:17.110
Madam Nabara and Merle
will stay here with Dai!

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.370
It's too dangerous!

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:26.200
You can't fight Baran and leave unscathed!
You'll need my Healing-type spells!

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.970
Very well.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:42.270
You're not one to be
talked out of your decisions.

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:45.510
Exactly. Let's get going!

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:51.440
Madam Nabara, Merle,
don't let Dai out of his cell!

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:58.900
What is it, miss?

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:10.790
What?! What are you doing?!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.170
Stand still.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.760
Huh?! What is this?!

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:17.380
A weapon! Use it to defend yourself!

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.420
D-Defend myself?

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:23.350
Isn't it obvious? You use this to fight!

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:26.760
No way! I can't! It's too scary!

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.930
Take it off, miss!

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:55.380
Dai, I've told you before. You're a Hero!

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:59.930
You're small but brave
and bright and sincere.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.090
That's the real you!

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:08.180
This cowardly you isn't a Hero!
It isn't who Dai is!

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:13.600
That's not true. I can't be a Hero.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:23.110
Besides, if we wait,
someone will come to protect me.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:29.120
<i>He instinctively senses
that Baran is his father after all.</i>

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:31.620
You're wrong.

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:34.120
That's the enemy!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:36.130
The enemy?

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:42.390
That's right! He took precious
memories of us from you!

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:44.180
He's a terrible enemy!

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.800
Don't be happy that he's coming!

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.350
Princess Leona...

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:55.090
Fight, Dai! Fight to regain what's yours!

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:57.520
Your memories and courage!

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:59.980
Courage...

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:02.910
Come, Crocodine.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.280
Understood.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:11.830
Come to think of it...

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:15.620
<i>I think... something like this....</i>

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.790
happened before.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:32.350
I see you aren't quite dead yet.
But I will not finish you off.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:36.520
You can wallow in shame
and feel regret as you bleed out.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:42.690
I must hurry and regroup
with Master Baran to reclaim Master Dino.

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:46.490
<i>"Dino"? Does he mean Dai?</i>

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.250
You still bother to resist?

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:56.960
Father or not...
I can't let him... take Dai.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.880
Dai is...

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.250
Dai is...

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:09.050
the hope of all humans
living in this world!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:11.770
What rubbish!

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:16.900
The filthy humans of this world
don't deserve such a thing!

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:17.730
What?!

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:21.190
Very well.
I shall tell you before you die.

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:25.570
The reason why Master Baran hates humans!

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:32.990
The only woman Master Baran ever loved,
in other words, Master Dino's mother...

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.910
was murdered by humans!

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:39.830
The ones who killed Dai's mother
were humans?!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:44.960
Why would humans...
Just who was Dai's mother?!

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:56.230
Normally, only one
Dragon Knight exists at a time.

00:06:56.230 --> 00:07:00.480
The power of a Dragon Knight
can reshape the heavens and earth.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:06.610
Thus only one in a generation
can possess it in this world.

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:13.620
<i>When a Dragon Knight's life ends,
the Holy Mother Dragon descends.</i>

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:18.330
<i>It is said that she caringly cradles
the battle-weary knight's body.</i>

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:22.040
<i>And the Dragon Crest,
having fulfilled its duty,</i>

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:27.590
<i>is passed on to the life
the Mother Dragon carries within her.</i>

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:36.850
<i>A new knight now within her,
she gives birth in a distant land.</i>

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:41.570
<i>The humans there worship the child
as a divine child and raise it.</i>

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:47.270
And when the knight is fully grown,
it awakens to its duty.

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:53.080
Thus, no Dragon Knight ever knows
parent or offspring.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:58.620
They are destined to a life
of never-ending battle.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:02.630
But something unusual happened
in Master Baran's generation.

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:03.830
Fifteen years ago...

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:13.220
<i>When Hadlar laid waste to the world,
the Dragon Knight did not appear.</i>

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:17.730
<i>It was a human Hero who defeated Hadlar.</i>

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:18.890
Avan...!

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:24.110
At the time, Master Baran
was fighting a greater threat.

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:30.280
For it is a Dragon Knight's duty to punish
those who disrupt the world's balance.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:34.990
<i>Compared to the threat of
Velzar, King of the Abyss,</i>

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:39.870
<i>who was the last intelligent Dragon
seeking to conquer this world,</i>

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:44.290
<i>even Hadlar was trivial enough
to be ignored.</i>

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:53.880
<i>Having vanquished Velzar and his kin,
Master Baran was mortally wounded.</i>

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:57.680
<i>Master Baran used the last of his strength</i>

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:03.390
<i>to reach the Fountain of Miracles
said to heal Dragon Knights.</i>

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.700
I...

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.110
I was so close...

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.620
Drink this.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.040
It is said to ease wounds and illness.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.420
A human woman?

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:36.260
<i>That was Master Baran
and Lady Soala's meeting.</i>

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:45.060
<i>Weary from battle, Master Baran
found the sun in Lady Soala.</i>

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:48.650
<i>Eventually, love between them blossomed.</i>

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:55.280
<i>Lady Soala was princess of Alkeed Kingdom
and when Master Baran came to the palace,</i>

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:58.110
<i>the two grew even closer.</i>

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:02.120
<i>But there were vassals
who found this displeasing.</i>

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:07.130
<i>They couldn't stand a stranger
winning claim to the throne.</i>

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:11.090
Your Majesty, there are rumors
that knight is not human.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:12.510
W-What?!

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:16.130
He may be a surviving servant
of the Dark Lord.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:26.520
<i>The fear of Hadlar being a recent memory,
the humans banished Master Baran.</i>

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:31.810
Soala...

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:44.740
It seems life with a human
was never meant for me.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.500
My time with you was a happy one.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:50.920
Farewell.

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:56.420
Baran!

00:10:57.510 --> 00:11:01.430
Please! Don't leave us!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:03.230
"Us"?!

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:05.390
Soala, are you with child?!

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:08.730
Unbelievable!

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:15.270
The Dragon Knight...
A bloodstained Slayer has sired a child?!

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:29.790
Then that child...!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.790
It is Master Dino.

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:38.010
<i>Dai is the child of
a Dragon Knight and a human?!</i>

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:39.760
The three of them...

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:44.220
<i>lived quietly,
deep in the forests of Teran.</i>

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:48.180
Soala, what shall we name him?

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:55.270
How about Dino? It means
"Strong Dragon" in the Alkeed language.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:58.860
Dino, the Strong Dragon. A good name!

00:11:58.860 --> 00:11:59.950
Dino!

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:01.280
Oh dear...

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:08.210
Dino, don't worry.
That was scary, wasn't it?

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:09.880
<i>But the humans...</i>

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:14.170
did not let them enjoy
their days of peace for long.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:18.210
<i>A monster kidnapping their princess
would shame their country.</i>

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:24.050
<i>Enraged, the king hunted them down
and surrounded them with a battalion.</i>

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:26.890
My love!

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:30.060
<i>I mustn't kill any humans.</i>

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:35.600
<i>Master Baran made his decision.</i>

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.400
Wait, my love!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:43.700
I surrender.
But do not harm Soala or my son.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:47.620
Very well. He may be a monster's spawn,
but he's still my grandson.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:52.580
He cannot stay here,
but I shall send him to a foreign land.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:57.540
<i>Master Baran allowed
the Alkeed soldiers to capture him.</i>

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:04.760
<i>And Master Dino was taken from Lady Soala
and sent to a foreign land.</i>

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:07.930
You are sentenced to death!

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.940
<i>Soala... Dino... May you find happiness.</i>

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:16.690
Fire!

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:19.610
No!

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:48.300
Soala?

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:49.850
Soala!

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:51.510
Soala!

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:55.350
M-My love...

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:59.020
How foolish! Why would you do this?!

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:06.450
I-I couldn't bear...
to see my father and the others...

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:10.990
continue... such cruelty.

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:12.950
Soala!

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:17.870
But... please don't hate humans.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.710
They're all just scared.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.960
Enough! Don't speak!

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:25.710
Please...

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:29.220
Find... Dino...

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:34.140
And live together... in peace...

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:48.150
Soala?

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.250
Soala!

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:03.130
That fool! To die for a monster?!
What a disgrace!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.960
A disgrace?!

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:10.310
Just who do you think you are?!

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:14.050
Begone! Begone, humans!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:20.020
<i>Alkeed Kingdom vanished from this world.</i>

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:23.650
What hopelessly selfish creatures!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:30.030
To think I fought the King of the Abyss
to protect such swine!

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:34.950
If I knew humans were such filth...

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:38.790
I never would have protected them!

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:45.840
Master Baran searched the world,
but he never found Master Dino.

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:49.970
<i>Apparently, the ship was lost at sea.</i>

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:55.800
It was in his deepest despair
that Vearn, the Dark King approached him.

00:15:56.390 --> 00:16:00.060
He said, "Don't you think the humans
should be wiped out first?"

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:04.400
This is Master Baran's sad past
that he has told only me.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.820
What?! You still...?!

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:11.610
Larhart, you are indeed powerful.

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:16.330
I doubt I even have
the strength left to stand.

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:22.590
But, after hearing that story,
I realized I had to get back up.

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:24.460
For Dai...

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:26.670
and for Baran!

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:32.550
BEAST KING REDEMPTION BLAST

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:37.550
AVAN STRASH

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.650
For Master Baran?!

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:45.780
I know very well how Baran feels.

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:46.860
What?!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:51.320
I, too, once lost faith
in the human world.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:56.280
I sold my soul to the Dark Army,
and sought to destroy everything.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:58.620
But I realized...

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:02.330
No, my friends made me realize...

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:06.670
that there was still hope
for the human world!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:11.840
And now, I want to
help Baran realize this.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.930
I might be able to...

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:17.520
What could you possibly know?!

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:23.350
You think Master Baran's pain
is something so light that you can ease?!

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.850
Don't make me laugh!

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:31.490
Impossible! I aimed for your heart!

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:33.990
I can see through your attacks!

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:35.110
What?!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:37.410
To be honest,

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:42.880
I was fighting you
while saving myself to fight Baran.

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:49.460
That's why I tried to keep my distance
when dodging your attacks.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:55.550
But now, I don't care
if you hit me or not!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:18:00.390
This is what allows me
to barely dodge any mortal blows!

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:02.470
Cocky bastard!

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.520
Where does this strength come from?!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:50.030
And you're faster than before!

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:53.610
This is the power a human wields
when risking his life!

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.190
I won't accept that!

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:20.800
You were wise to bring the fight in close.

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:26.150
But once distance is gained,
a sword cannot beat a spear!

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:29.770
I doubt you can even move now.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:33.360
I could end this with a single thrust...

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:36.900
but that won't satisfy my anger!

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:39.120
<i>His Sunder Claw!</i>

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:42.820
Feel the sting of my claw once more!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:49.120
Die a ghastly death!
As punishment for your nonsense!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:54.540
Sunder Claw!

00:19:55.500 --> 00:20:01.470
I've got you! You fell for
my final life-risking trap!

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:02.260
What?!

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:08.310
Take a good look at the shape of the Aura
our weapons create!

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:10.850
A cross?!

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:15.440
Grand Cross!

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.900
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:24.200
<i>He was hiding a weapon
charged with his Aura?!</i>

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:28.830
<i>But he was completely defenseless!</i>

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:45.090
W-Where did you hide such a weapon?!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:50.350
This was the only weapon I had left!

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:56.030
That flimsy little chain?

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:59.110
This chain is unbreakable.

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:05.330
It is a symbol of
the bond of the Disciples of Avan!

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:08.120
The bond...

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:25.180
Using Grand Cross
leaves me weak for a while.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.350
You're still alive?!

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:40.440
Very well.
This time I'll pierce your face!

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:43.320
Can you?

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:46.200
Popp!

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:51.920
Drop your weapon!
Otherwise, I crush the boy's skull!

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:53.250
You dirty...!

00:21:56.870 --> 00:22:00.590
Don't!

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:07.430
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:11.390
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:11.350
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:15.480
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:15.430
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:19.530
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:19.480
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:19.530 --> 00:22:22.820
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.780
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:26.740
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:26.700
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:30.450
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:30.410
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:30.450 --> 00:22:34.830
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:34.700
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:38.750
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:38.750
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.540
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.540
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:48.130
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:48.260
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.770
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:57.570
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:57.570 --> 00:22:59.860
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:22:59.810
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:59.860 --> 00:23:04.030
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:03.980
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:23:04.030 --> 00:23:08.530
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:08.490
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:11.700
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:11.660
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:16.380
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

00:23:16.380 --> 00:23:22.580
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:22.540
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:38.180
<i>After a fierce battle, Larhart entrusts
Hyunckel and Popp with his last wish.</i>

00:23:38.180 --> 00:23:43.690
<i>Meanwhile, Dragon Master General Baran
finally arrives at Teran Castle.</i>

00:23:43.690 --> 00:23:46.660
<i>Crocodine risks his life to face Baran,</i>

00:23:46.660 --> 00:23:52.160
<i>but Baran eventually reveals
his true power full of grief and rage.</i>

00:23:52.160 --> 00:23:54.460
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:54.460 --> 00:23:56.210
<i>"Baran's Rage"</i>

00:23:56.210 --> 00:23:58.200
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
